Dialogue: 99,0:00:34.93,0:00:38.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uru 6 către Sediul Central: \Nținta intră districtul Edobashi.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:38.60,0:00:41.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Blocați ieșirile de la \NM4 până la M11, terminat.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:41.40,0:00:42.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aici Sediul Central, recepționat.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:42.81,0:00:47.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Închidem ieșirile de la M4 până la \NM11 și pe cele de la M12 până la M14.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:51.51,0:00:54.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cât crezi că e limita de viteză?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:57.12,0:00:58.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yuka!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:06.86,0:01:10.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sediul Central, aici Daisen 9, pornim în urmărire, terminat.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:10.90,0:01:12.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aici Sediul Central, recepționat.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:12.42,0:01:13.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yuka...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:13.97,0:01:16.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu reușim s-o contactăm pe Maki.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:16.14,0:01:18.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poți încerca tu?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:21.98,0:01:23.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Recepționat.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:37.56,0:01:39.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prezentă. Care-i treaba?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:40.00,0:01:44.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu ne lua cu asta. \NCe tot faci de nu răspunzi?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:44.38,0:01:46.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scuze, scuze!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:46.00,0:01:47.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Transmit datele.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:47.74,0:01:49.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acum, dacă ești atât de amabilă, alătură-te și tu celorlalți.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:50.44,0:01:54.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Suspecții se îndreaptă acum pe \Nautostrada Shutoko 9 direct spre Tazumi.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:55.04,0:01:58.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De asemenea, vă informăm că suspecții se crede că țin un ostatic.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:58.15,0:02:02.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta înseamnă un civil nevinovat, Maki, așa că nu te arunca cu capul înainte, ca de obicei!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:02.05,0:02:03.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, da.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:38.79,0:02:39.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La naiba!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:39.79,0:02:41.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bine, ticăloșilor.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:53.60,0:02:55.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La naiba!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:56.67,0:02:58.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Blue 11, aici Cartierul General.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:58.67,0:03:00.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ținta urmează să treacă chiar pe sub voi.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:00.68,0:03:01.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mișcați-vă, terminat!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:01.94,0:03:04.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aici Blue 11, înțeles.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:17.76,0:03:20.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maki, ești la 30 de secunde în urmă.\NPoți recupera?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:21.23,0:03:22.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dacă pot?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:23.17,0:03:25.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cu cine crezi că vorbești?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:07.31,0:04:09.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tu ești cea care se târăște în urmă, Reimi!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:12.66,0:04:15.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La naiba! Sunt din nou pe urmele noastre!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:21.56,0:04:23.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acum ai făcut-o!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:03.43,0:05:05.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...și astfel, după ce am verificat tot ce a spus și nu a spus răpitorul nostru
Dialogue: 99,0:05:05.47,0:05:10.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,în timpul arestării sale, comparând cu dosarele noastre codificate despre crima organizată,
Dialogue: 99,0:05:10.14,0:05:13.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,sunt acum convins că lucrau pentru familia Paulo.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:13.91,0:05:15.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu direct sub ordinele lui Paulo?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:15.98,0:05:19.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu, peștișorii ăștia lucrează pentru McCoy.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:20.75,0:05:23.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Samuel McCoy. Nu s-a mulțumit cu traficul de sclave albe,
Dialogue: 99,0:05:23.75,0:05:26.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,mai deține și un lanț de cluburi și restaurante cu prețuri exorbitante.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:26.42,0:05:30.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Până acum, n-am avut nicio acuzație care să se lipească de fundul lui uns cu teflon,
Dialogue: 99,0:05:30.29,0:05:32.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,dar cu un canar care va cânta ca să-și salveze pielea.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:32.93,0:05:34.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kenji, Banba.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:34.70,0:05:36.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vă pun pe voi doi să vă ocupați de bătaia ultimului cui în sicriu.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:36.70,0:05:38.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îl vreau pe ticălosul ăsta condamnat!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:39.13,0:05:42.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Înțeles, domnule. Considerați că e rezolvat.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:58.15,0:06:01.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Șefule, despre „incidentul” Yamazaki din această dimineață...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:02.26,0:06:04.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yamazaki și Watanabe au fost uciși,
Dialogue: 99,0:06:04.36,0:06:06.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,dar Fukazawa s-a lăsat capturat de Poliția Municipală.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:06.81,0:06:10.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Proștii care se lasă încolțiți de câini nu merită deloc preocuparea mea.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:10.27,0:06:14.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pe de altă parte, pierderea chiar și a unei singure „achiziții” este de neiertat,
Dialogue: 99,0:06:14.64,0:06:17.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,mai ales acum, când stocul de marfă a scăzut deja sub comenzile în avans.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:18.27,0:06:20.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inițiați imediat un nou program de recrutare.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:20.28,0:06:22.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fără marfă, nu suntem nimic.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:24.21,0:06:27.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Șefule, domnul Gerald este aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:33.49,0:06:37.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ca întotdeauna, afacerea dumneavoastră este plăcerea noastră, președinte Gerald.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:37.18,0:06:38.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scutiți-mă de politețurile de formă.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:38.49,0:06:41.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Să înțeleg că, în sfârșit, ați reușit să-mi onorați comanda?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:41.00,0:06:42.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chiar și pentru mine, un milion nu e mărunțiș.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:43.17,0:06:45.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Răbdarea este o virtute bine răsplătită.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:45.17,0:06:47.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vă garantez că randamentul investiției dumneavoastră va merita din plin osteneala.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:48.50,0:06:50.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scuzați-ne, domnilor.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:00.55,0:07:04.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Este gata, domnule Gerald.\NEste a dumneavoastră, faceți ce doriți cu ea.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:09.89,0:07:14.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Detectivul Abe, vă rog.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:11.71,0:07:14.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aveți un apel telefonic.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:45.96,0:07:48.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu mai suport asta!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:49.50,0:07:52.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O, Maki, termină cu prostiile.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:52.60,0:07:54.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu mă prostesc!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:54.90,0:07:56.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu o mai da cotită!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:01.81,0:08:02.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:03.28,0:08:04.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kenji!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:07.68,0:08:09.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai crezut că sunt șeful, nu-i așa?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:09.35,0:08:10.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, m-ai prins.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:11.19,0:08:14.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,M-am gândit că ai vrea să știi despre golanii pe care i-am adus mai devreme.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:14.29,0:08:16.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Se pare că sunt ai lui McCoy.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:16.65,0:08:18.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,McCoy?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:18.46,0:08:21.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Un traficant de carne umană foarte cunoscut, cu o clientelă de elită.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:21.70,0:08:25.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Afacerile lui principale sunt „reeducarea” și distribuirea fetelor tinere.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:25.43,0:08:27.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,„Reeducarea?”
Dialogue: 99,0:08:27.57,0:08:29.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ei bine, știi tu...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:30.61,0:08:33.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta reflectă o atitudine destul de lipsită de scrupule față de femei, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:33.48,0:08:36.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și cineva ca mine ar putea fi răpită, de asemenea!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:43.15,0:08:46.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ei bine, hai să-l prindem pe ticălos!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:46.19,0:08:47.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu te agita atât.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:47.76,0:08:50.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu putem pune mâna pe el fără dovezi solide.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:51.23,0:08:52.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:56.23,0:08:58.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te-ai rănit din nou?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:58.47,0:09:00.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aș vrea să încetezi să-ți mai riști profilul ăla superb.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:00.84,0:09:02.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu e nimic, serios...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:03.57,0:09:06.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mă gândesc la tine în fiecare clipă în care sunt treaz. Îmi fac griji.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:06.22,0:09:07.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Serios?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:08.58,0:09:10.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Când poți să pleci?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:13.15,0:09:15.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cred că pot până la șapte.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:15.42,0:09:18.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te iau din față, bine?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:18.59,0:09:19.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ține-te tare.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:23.30,0:09:26.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, iubirea tânără. Ce dulce, pură și hormonală.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:26.03,0:09:28.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, taci, Reimi.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:29.70,0:09:31.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,„Mă gândesc la tine în fiecare clipă în care sunt treaz.”
Dialogue: 99,0:09:33.03,0:09:35.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doar să vă ascult pe voi doi îmi ajunge ca să fac diabet!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:36.51,0:09:37.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Au!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:38.51,0:09:40.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Atunci ține-ți urechile pentru tine!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:40.15,0:09:42.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oooo, o întâlnire fierbinte?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:43.45,0:09:46.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pot să vin și eu să mă uit?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:51.49,0:09:53.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Glumeam!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:13.28,0:10:17.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar, știi, uneori mi-aș dori și eu un iubit ca el.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:17.28,0:10:20.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu ești singura care simte monstrul cu ochii verzi.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:20.55,0:10:24.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce? Adică nici tu nu-ți poți găsi iubit?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:27.76,0:10:29.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Este doar o situație temporară.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:29.89,0:10:31.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alo.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:37.10,0:10:40.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lovitură cu cotul! Lovitură cu cotul! Lovitură cu cotul!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:41.40,0:10:43.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O, Doamne.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:45.13,0:10:47.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce voiai, Banba?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:48.54,0:10:51.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Voiam doar să știu unde a plecat Kenji.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:51.35,0:10:53.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De unde să știu eu?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:47.54,0:11:48.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce este?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:48.97,0:11:51.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maki, ești atât de frumoasă.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:51.64,0:11:52.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prostuțule.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:03.92,0:12:05.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alo!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:04.22,0:12:05.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, tu!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:08.42,0:12:10.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cum naiba ne-ai găsit?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:13.86,0:12:16.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai folosit nenorocitul ăla de computer de buzunar al tău, nu-i așa?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:16.20,0:12:19.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am făcut-o doar pentru că Banba a spus că este atât de important.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:21.04,0:12:22.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bine, ce este atât de urgent, Banba?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:23.10,0:12:24.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uită-te.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:25.81,0:12:28.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta se bazează pe informațiile pe care le-am scos de la turnătorul nostru.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:29.61,0:12:30.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kenji?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:30.95,0:12:32.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Satelitul 7?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:33.58,0:12:36.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Este noul local de noapte la modă din Roppongi.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:36.69,0:12:38.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Știu totul despre el.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:39.42,0:12:42.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mai important, știm acum că majoritatea fetelor dispărute
Dialogue: 99,0:12:42.19,0:12:44.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,au fost luate din imediata vecinătate.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:44.53,0:12:46.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu crezi că McCoy deține...?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:44.53,0:12:46.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acolo eu...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:46.59,0:12:50.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Puțin probabil. Satellite 7 este probabil doar un alt loc de distracție pentru adulți, cu prețuri exorbitante.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:50.47,0:12:53.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar, pe de altă parte, este exact genul de loc care atrage fete tinere.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:54.54,0:12:57.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Banba, va trebui să abordăm situația foarte atent.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:57.94,0:13:00.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-ar trebui mult ca să compromitem totul.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:00.78,0:13:03.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mă voi ocupa de verificările ulterioare mâine.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:03.07,0:13:05.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vrei să intrăm sub acoperire?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:05.01,0:13:08.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maki, nu vreau să te implici deloc în ancheta asta!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:09.42,0:13:11.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu trebuie să-mi mănânci capul!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:11.09,0:13:13.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar eu cunosc locul acela!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:15.06,0:13:16.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dând înapoi...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:18.06,0:13:19.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dând înapoi...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:22.80,0:13:25.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mă bazez pe tine, Kenji!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:25.03,0:13:27.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu-ți face griji, e floare la ureche!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:29.74,0:13:31.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei! E timpul interogatoriului.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:41.45,0:13:42.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La naiba!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:51.26,0:13:53.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sub ochii voștri,
Dialogue: 99,0:13:53.46,0:13:55.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,forțele Iadului se ridică din nou!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:56.06,0:13:58.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acum trebuie să o salvați pe Prințesa aflată în primejdie din ghearele lor infernale!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:00.74,0:14:04.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Quest Dragon, numărul treizeci și unu:\NRoagă-te pentru eternitate!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:04.87,0:14:08.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O nouă legendă se va naște!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:18.19,0:14:21.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maki, nu sunt prea sigur că ar trebui să facem asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:21.99,0:14:24.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu crezi că e puțin cam târziu să-ți exprimi obiecțiile?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:24.03,0:14:25.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:25.19,0:14:27.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu ți-ar păsa dacă o altă fată nevinovată ar deveni victima în seara asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:28.30,0:14:31.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ei bine, doar că...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:31.63,0:14:34.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uite, doar să nu faci nimic care ar putea provoca probleme!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:34.40,0:14:35.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Știu asta!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:37.31,0:14:39.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Voi verifica etajele unu până la trei.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:39.07,0:14:40.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Reimi se ocupă de patru și cinci.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:40.71,0:14:42.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yuka, uită-te bine în subsol.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:42.18,0:14:44.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dacă vezi ceva, anunță-ne imediat prin radio.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:44.41,0:14:45.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:45.31,0:14:47.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ne întâlnim din nou aici la miezul nopții!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:06.93,0:15:09.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, drăguțo...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:10.10,0:15:11.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:16.34,0:15:18.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ăă, nimic.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:18.48,0:15:19.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scuze...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:21.08,0:15:23.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De ce nu pot să-mi fac prieteni și să-i influențez pe oameni?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:26.88,0:16:30.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uau! Asta pare distractiv!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:51.67,0:16:54.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Locul ăsta pare suspect și nu e nimeni la vedere.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:16.06,0:17:17.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cine este acolo?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:17.20,0:17:20.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îmi pare rău, domnișoară, dar trebuie să fac curățenie aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:26.94,0:17:32.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Șederea dumneavoastră aici va fi mult mai plăcută dacă rămâneți în zonele oficiale ale clubului.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:56.50,0:17:59.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ei bine, nu sunt oameni suspecți aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:04.51,0:18:05.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce-i asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:06.38,0:18:09.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mă întreb ce face?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:15.49,0:18:16.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Salut!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:18.36,0:18:21.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu ai prieteni cu care să stai?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:21.16,0:18:24.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sau ești doar obosită de la prea mult dans?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:24.37,0:18:26.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Știi, să stai singură poate fi periculos.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:26.30,0:18:30.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mai ales cu toți „lupii” de aici, care așteaptă o fată drăguță ca tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:31.61,0:18:33.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu mă sperie.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:35.64,0:18:37.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Numele meu este Yuka.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:37.98,0:18:40.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iubitul meu trebuia să se întâlnească cu mine.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:45.39,0:18:48.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu plânge, nu plânge!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:48.09,0:18:51.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A spus că mă iubește mai mult decât pe oricine altcineva.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:55.56,0:18:58.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu sunt pregătită să mă ocup de asta!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:03.25,0:19:06.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te rog, nu mai plânge.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:08.01,0:19:09.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așteaptă puțin.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:19.69,0:19:20.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bine!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:39.25,0:19:41.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce faci acolo?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:43.09,0:19:46.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poliția! Nimeni nu se mișcă!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:49.93,0:19:53.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bine, acum ridică încet mâinile deasupra capului.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:10.07,0:20:10.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ticălosule!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:18.88,0:20:20.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La naiba.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:35.66,0:20:40.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dr. Nakumura, Obstetrică și Ginecologie, vă rog să veniți în sala de nașteri numărul doi.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:41.64,0:20:43.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai avut noroc.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:43.94,0:20:48.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am avut antidotul doar pentru că victima nr. 24 fusese injectată cu aceeași toxină.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:49.11,0:20:54.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dacă nu l-am fi avut la îndemână, Maki, picioarele alea de care ești atât de mândră ar fi trebuit amputate.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:54.92,0:20:56.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei! Cum merge!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:56.48,0:20:57.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kenji!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:57.92,0:20:59.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ei, cum a mers?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:02.04,0:21:03.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De ce nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:03.76,0:21:06.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pur și simplu nu sunt suficiente dovezi.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:06.09,0:21:08.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Singurii martori ați fost voi doi.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:08.76,0:21:11.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și fără ceva mai concret, conducerea nu ne va da undă verde.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:12.47,0:21:16.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acele ace pe care le-au scos din noi nu sunt dovezi suficiente?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:16.22,0:21:19.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ne ocupăm de asta, dar va dura.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:19.61,0:21:23.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acum spune-mi, acesta este tipul care v-a atacat pe voi două?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:29.02,0:21:30.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,El este, fără îndoială!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:30.95,0:21:32.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cine este ticălosul?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:32.59,0:21:35.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îl cheamă Ganack,\Nasasinul principal al lui McCoy.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:40.06,0:21:42.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Trebuie să vorbesc cu șeful!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:44.37,0:21:46.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maki, ești în afara uniformei!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:56.11,0:21:57.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești bine?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:59.65,0:22:01.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cine ești?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:01.92,0:22:03.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unde sunt?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:04.25,0:22:08.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Locul acesta îi aparține lui McCoy, traficantul de sclave albe.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:08.26,0:22:11.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai fost răpită și adusă aici, la fel ca noi celelalte.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:11.76,0:22:13.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Noi?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:15.53,0:22:18.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mai este ceva ce trebuie să știi.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:19.74,0:22:23.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Odată ce ai fost adusă aici, există doar două căi de ieșire.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:24.97,0:22:28.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poți deveni ceea ce vor ei să fii sau te poți sinucide.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:28.28,0:22:32.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu trebuia să spui asta!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:41.16,0:22:43.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cine sunteți voi?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:43.16,0:22:44.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unde sunt?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:52.70,0:22:54.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești polițistă?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:54.54,0:22:58.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O să ne spui ce vrem să știm, nu-i așa?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:08.45,0:23:10.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai capul în fund!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:28.24,0:23:30.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Șefule, nu poți face nimic?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:30.97,0:23:33.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,În legătură cu cea pe care am pierdut-o?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:33.17,0:23:36.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești detectivă, ar trebui să-ți dai seama cum stau lucrurile.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:36.21,0:23:38.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Trebuie să existe ceva.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:38.23,0:23:41.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dacă aș ști ceva, n-ar mai exista situația asta!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:46.59,0:23:48.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bătrânul ăla laș și flecar!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:50.16,0:23:52.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu-mi lasă altă opțiune.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:52.16,0:23:55.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O, nu, Maki, nici să nu te gândești la asta!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:55.42,0:23:58.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Există o limită până la câtă „inițiativă personală” poate tolera cineva!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:58.33,0:24:00.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pur și simplu ai de gând să renunți la Yuka?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:08.84,0:24:11.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, Moșule! Ești aici?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:14.98,0:24:19.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Numele meu nu este „Moșule”!\NȘi poți să-mi spui „Domnule”!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:19.08,0:24:22.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Știi, faptul că faci parte din echipa S.W.A.T. de rezervă
Dialogue: 99,0:24:22.22,0:24:26.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,nu-ți dă autoritatea să intri și să ieși de aici după bunul plac.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:26.96,0:24:28.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așadar, de ce ai nevoie?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:30.60,0:24:32.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Trebuie s-o salvez pe Yuka.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:39.77,0:24:41.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pe aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:43.38,0:24:45.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești sigură de asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:45.28,0:24:48.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E la fel de simplu ca să ții o barcă de salvare pe uscat.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:48.52,0:24:50.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aș prefera să am un cuirasat acum.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:53.62,0:24:54.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ia.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:55.09,0:24:57.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Reimi, încearcă asta!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:01.43,0:25:03.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce este?
Dialogue: 99,0:25:04.73,0:25:07.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doar ceva ce am comandat special acum ceva timp.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:07.13,0:25:08.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are 30 de cartușe numai în încărcător.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:08.87,0:25:11.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,În plus, are și un lansator de grenade mic și drăguț!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:12.77,0:25:14.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așteaptă!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:14.61,0:25:18.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Moșule, voi avea nevoie de vreo două sute de încărcătoare suplimentare și de niște „fursecuri”.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:18.29,0:25:20.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu sunt atât de bătrân!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:20.71,0:25:22.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai grijă, trebuie să-ți urmărești tensiunea arterială!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:35.70,0:25:39.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eu eram acolo doar pentru distracție!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:40.37,0:25:41.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Minti!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:48.64,0:25:51.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Se pare că ne-ai adus o complicație neașteptată.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:53.21,0:25:56.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cine s-ar fi gândit că o prostuță ca ea ar putea fi polițistă?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:02.76,0:26:06.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maki, te voi întreba asta pentru ultima oară.\NChiar ai de gând să mergi până la capăt cu asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:06.76,0:26:09.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ar putea s-o execute pe Yuka în orice clipă!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:09.46,0:26:11.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu putem lăsa totul în seama șefului și a prețioaselor lui „canale”.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:13.17,0:26:15.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bine. Ți-ai susținut punctul de vedere.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:16.14,0:26:18.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar dacă tot vom fi polițiști rebeli, măcar să o facem cu stil.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:19.41,0:26:21.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta e partenera mea!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:21.52,0:26:22.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Corect.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:23.31,0:26:25.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La cât ai setat-o?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:26.01,0:26:27.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La un minut de acum.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:31.49,0:26:32.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Să-i dăm drumul!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:45.43,0:26:46.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stai, Maki!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:46.97,0:26:48.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce faci aici?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:48.24,0:26:50.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Păi, mi s-a spus să mă prezint aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:50.97,0:26:52.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ciudat, nimeni nu mi-a spus nimic.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:52.61,0:26:54.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așteaptă aici cât verific!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:55.51,0:26:57.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce-a fost asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:58.15,0:27:00.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mai bine arunc o privire.\NRămâi aici, bine?
Dialogue: 99,0:27:02.48,0:27:04.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La timp.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:04.55,0:27:05.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Firește.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:16.43,0:27:17.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Să mergem!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:18.90,0:27:21.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei! Stai o secundă! Oprește-te!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:28.98,0:27:31.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alo? Da, eu sunt.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:32.48,0:27:33.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:37.72,0:27:40.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Venim, Yuka.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:45.29,0:27:48.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ne vom hotărî mai târziu ce să facem cu tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:48.45,0:27:50.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poartă-te frumos până atunci.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:01.11,0:28:05.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Verser 9, răspundeți, vă rog.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:08.18,0:28:10.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Verser 9, răspundeți, vă rog.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:10.78,0:28:13.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Verser 9, răspundeți, vă rog.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:13.26,0:28:15.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-ați găsit?
Dialogue: 99,0:28:15.52,0:28:17.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dați-mi un minut, vă rog.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:25.03,0:28:26.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A venit timpul.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:38.35,0:28:39.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-am găsit!
Dialogue: 99,0:28:39.85,0:28:42.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt în districtul Sumida: Secțiunea 4, blocul 7.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:42.28,0:28:44.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Se îndreaptă spre vest cu 40 km/h.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:44.62,0:28:47.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Știam eu! Se îndreaptă direct spre complexul lui McCoy!
Dialogue: 99,0:29:07.77,0:29:08.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acum!
Dialogue: 99,0:29:11.49,0:29:12.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dați-i drumul!
Dialogue: 99,0:29:25.59,0:29:29.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Șefule! Un vehicul blindat cu însemnele Poliției Municipale atacă perimetrul complexului!
Dialogue: 99,0:29:30.23,0:29:34.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta cu greu este o chestiune care să mă preocupe.\NEliminați-l discret și rapid.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:34.37,0:29:37.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar, șefule! Sunt polițiști!
Dialogue: 99,0:29:37.14,0:29:40.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Domnule Suzuki, după cum ați spus chiar dumneavoastră, este doar unul.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:40.97,0:29:43.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cred că suntem capabili să suportăm consecințele distrugerii
Dialogue: 99,0:29:43.14,0:29:44.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,unei singure mașini blindate de asalt a poliției.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:54.72,0:29:56.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sala de operațiuni!
Dialogue: 99,0:29:56.66,0:29:57.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:58.23,0:29:59.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:59.53,0:30:00.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Recepționat!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:00.79,0:30:01.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Șefule!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:02.06,0:30:06.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Avem rapoarte despre focuri de armă în Sumida!\NSecțiunea 4, blocul 7!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:08.57,0:30:11.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Șefule! Dați-ne aprobarea să intervenim!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:11.54,0:30:13.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îmi asum întreaga responsabilitate!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:17.81,0:30:19.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Șefule, intru.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:19.88,0:30:21.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Puteți decide sancțiunile disciplinare potrivite după ce se risipește fumul.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:21.92,0:30:25.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Detectiv Asada, încerci în mod deliberat să-mi provoci o hemoragie cerebrală?
Dialogue: 99,0:30:25.27,0:30:28.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dacă așteptăm aprobarea pe canalele oficiale, singurul lucru rămas de făcut va fi să strângem cenușa!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:29.44,0:30:30.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asada!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:34.16,0:30:35.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Șefule!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:38.50,0:30:42.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Un lucru este clar. Trebuie să stingem focul acesta înainte să se extindă și să se transforme în ceva mai rău.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:42.04,0:30:44.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chiar și fără să luăm în calcul siguranța propriilor noștri ofițeri,
Dialogue: 99,0:30:44.30,0:30:47.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,nu putem risca să fie prinși civili în focul încrucișat!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:47.54,0:30:49.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Căpitane Hasima, ești responsabil de stingerea acestui incendiu!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:49.51,0:30:51.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mobilizați S.W.A.T.-ul Poliției Municipale!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:51.65,0:30:52.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, domnule!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:56.63,0:30:59.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Toate echipele S.W.A.T., în mișcare!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:59.52,0:31:02.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Toate echipele S.W.A.T., mobilizarea!
Dialogue: 99,0:31:03.16,0:31:06.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ținta: Complexul McCoy,\Ndistrictul Sumida, Secțiunea 4, blocul 7!
Dialogue: 99,0:31:10.76,0:31:13.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sarcini: Mai întâi, asigurați sprijinul\Nrezerviștilor S.W.A.T. angajați la fața locului.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:13.97,0:31:18.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,În al doilea rând, salvați ofițera adjunctă ținută ostatică în interiorul complexului.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:33.49,0:31:34.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce-a fost asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:55.61,0:31:57.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unde țineți fetele răpite?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:59.08,0:32:01.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sau vrei să pierzi zece kilograme de grăsime urâtă pe calea grea?
Dialogue: 99,0:32:02.75,0:32:05.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt în subsol, sub turnul din spate.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:05.65,0:32:06.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mulțumesc!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:23.54,0:32:24.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ganack!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:48.83,0:32:50.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yuka, ești acolo?
Dialogue: 99,0:32:50.33,0:32:51.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maki!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:51.40,0:32:53.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt aici! Aici!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:54.17,0:32:56.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dați-ne o secundă să deschidem ușa.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:05.21,0:33:07.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ofițer superior!
Dialogue: 99,0:33:18.76,0:33:20.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maki! Vehiculul blindat!
Dialogue: 99,0:33:35.04,0:33:36.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, dar acolo?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:36.71,0:33:38.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vezi ceva?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:39.51,0:33:41.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Reimi, cum e pe aici?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:47.05,0:33:50.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cea mai bună șansă să ieșim de aici este fereastra din camera de la capătul holului.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:50.56,0:33:51.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:52.59,0:33:54.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-a găsit cineva?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:54.16,0:33:56.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu, nu sunt aici!
Dialogue: 99,0:33:58.53,0:34:01.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Căutați mai bine! Trebuie să fie pe undeva pe aici!
Dialogue: 99,0:34:08.18,0:34:09.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Haide, repede!
Dialogue: 99,0:34:09.99,0:34:11.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-am găsit!
Dialogue: 99,0:34:12.71,0:34:14.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mișcați-vă!
Dialogue: 99,0:34:22.62,0:34:24.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mai repede, Banba!
Dialogue: 99,0:34:35.84,0:34:40.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Reimi, Yuka, duceți fetele în siguranță.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:40.17,0:34:41.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar tu?
Dialogue: 99,0:34:41.64,0:34:43.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mă duc după McCoy.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:43.48,0:34:45.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De data asta nu-l voi lăsa să scape!
Dialogue: 99,0:34:47.45,0:34:48.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ofițer superior.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:49.12,0:34:50.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vin cu tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:59.54,0:35:01.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yuka, ai grijă de ele.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:03.40,0:35:04.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Să mergem!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:13.47,0:35:14.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iată-i!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:37.62,0:35:40.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am localizat o grupare suspectă de inamici.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:40.63,0:35:42.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De unde știi?
Dialogue: 99,0:35:42.84,0:35:44.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tare, nu-i așa?
Dialogue: 99,0:35:44.64,0:35:47.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așadar, cum ajungem acolo de aici?
Dialogue: 99,0:35:49.24,0:35:50.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 99,0:35:50.98,0:35:52.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unde sunt?
Dialogue: 99,0:35:53.01,0:35:56.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, scuze. Sunt la etajul trei, aripa de est.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:28.12,0:36:30.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Reimi! Ești bine?
Dialogue: 99,0:36:31.92,0:36:34.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mă doare!
Dialogue: 99,0:36:44.02,0:36:45.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Reimi?
Dialogue: 99,0:36:55.08,0:36:57.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nenorocitule!
Dialogue: 99,0:37:02.78,0:37:04.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ia o clismă cu plumb, nenorocitule!
Dialogue: 99,0:37:05.39,0:37:07.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Arde în Iad, ticălosule!
Dialogue: 99,0:37:09.76,0:37:11.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Arde în Iad!
Dialogue: 99,0:37:13.86,0:37:16.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Reimi... scuză-mă...
Dialogue: 99,0:37:22.20,0:37:26.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Reimi, cred că focul tău îi atrage.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:35.52,0:37:37.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai spus ceva?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:38.39,0:37:39.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lasă.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:47.13,0:37:49.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te rog, ajută-mă!
Dialogue: 99,0:37:50.16,0:37:52.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai scăpat de ticăloșii aceia?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:52.00,0:37:53.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acum ești în siguranță!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:01.37,0:38:03.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cine... de ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:03.54,0:38:06.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stai acolo! Nu te mișca!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:09.05,0:38:11.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excelent, Sayaka!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:14.79,0:38:16.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Samuel!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:16.07,0:38:19.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bine ați venit, domnișoarelor de la Poliția Municipală.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:19.73,0:38:22.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am uitat cumva de vreo întâlnire?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:23.50,0:38:25.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,McCoy...
Dialogue: 99,0:38:31.50,0:38:33.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Atacați! Mișcați-vă!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:05.51,0:39:08.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De obicei nu-mi tratez oaspeții atât de aspru.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:08.24,0:39:11.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar, pe de altă parte, majoritatea oaspeților mei s-au purtat mai bine decât voi două.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:12.75,0:39:14.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce-i asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:39:15.85,0:39:18.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei! Vreau ca ușa asta să fie aruncată în aer, acum!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:18.34,0:39:19.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, domnule!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:37.50,0:39:40.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unde crezi că te duci, târfă?
Dialogue: 99,0:39:50.68,0:39:56.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vai, domnișoarelor, jocul a ajuns la final.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:56.52,0:39:58.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Trebuie să-mi iau rămas-bun.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:58.42,0:40:01.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Timpul meu este prețios și trebuie să merg mai departe.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:20.58,0:40:21.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ryuji!
Dialogue: 99,0:40:23.20,0:40:24.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La naiba!
Dialogue: 99,0:40:26.52,0:40:27.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stai!
Dialogue: 99,0:40:30.71,0:40:32.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Samuel McCoy!
Dialogue: 99,0:40:32.33,0:40:36.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te arestez sub acuzația de răpire și tentativă de omor!
Dialogue: 99,0:40:50.71,0:40:52.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maki, ești bine?
Dialogue: 99,0:40:54.68,0:40:56.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kenji!
Dialogue: 99,0:40:58.62,0:41:00.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Salut!
Dialogue: 99,0:41:00.65,0:41:02.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Banba!
Dialogue: 99,0:41:08.80,0:41:10.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,În sfârșit, în siguranță!
Dialogue: 99,0:41:22.24,0:41:27.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sirenele mașinilor de poliție se aud în tot orașul
Dialogue: 99,0:41:28.05,0:41:33.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu sunt ca orice altă fată, vezi tu
Dialogue: 99,0:41:34.25,0:41:40.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Compensez pentru neajunsurile tirului meu slab
Dialogue: 99,0:41:40.13,0:41:44.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Punându-mi personalitatea în valoare
Dialogue: 99,0:41:46.30,0:41:51.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Filozofia mea a fost întotdeauna să urmăresc
Dialogue: 99,0:41:51.87,0:41:56.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tot ce fuge de mine
Dialogue: 99,0:41:58.31,0:42:03.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Când vine vorba de dragoste, fac exact la fel
Dialogue: 99,0:42:03.95,0:42:09.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dragostea neîmpărtășită este singura pe care o cunosc
Dialogue: 99,0:42:10.26,0:42:13.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Arde-mi inima
Dialogue: 99,0:42:13.15,0:42:15.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Arde-mi inima
Dialogue: 99,0:42:15.80,0:42:19.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dă drumul urletului sirenei
Dialogue: 99,0:42:19.67,0:42:22.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Calcă accelerația până la podea
Dialogue: 99,0:42:22.74,0:42:25.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Arde-mi inima
Dialogue: 99,0:42:25.31,0:42:27.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Arde-mi inima
Dialogue: 99,0:42:27.57,0:42:30.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poate că sunt cam irascibilă
Dialogue: 99,0:42:30.61,0:42:33.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar furtunile trebuie să izbucnească
Dialogue: 99,0:42:33.55,0:42:38.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu vezi că sunt periculoasă?
Dialogue: 99,0:43:05.91,0:43:11.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,La prima întâlnire pot părea destul de obișnuită
Dialogue: 99,0:43:11.75,0:43:16.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chiar citesc horoscoapele din revistele acelea
Dialogue: 99,0:43:17.86,0:43:23.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Diferența este că știu că norocul va fi mereu de partea mea
Dialogue: 99,0:43:23.70,0:43:28.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eu îi spun puterea gândirii pozitive
Dialogue: 99,0:43:29.90,0:43:35.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Voi cădea doar când voi fi depășită
Dialogue: 99,0:43:35.41,0:43:40.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De un tip mai puternic decât mine
Dialogue: 99,0:43:41.90,0:43:47.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dacă încerci să mă prinzi fără să gândești
Dialogue: 99,0:43:47.39,0:43:53.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Crede-mă, te joci cu focul
Dialogue: 99,0:43:53.93,0:43:56.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Arde-mi inima
Dialogue: 99,0:43:56.89,0:43:59.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Arde-mi inima
Dialogue: 99,0:43:59.50,0:44:03.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acționează mecanismul manual
Dialogue: 99,0:44:03.30,0:44:06.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Viziera sus și gata
Dialogue: 99,0:44:06.41,0:44:08.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Arde-mi inima
Dialogue: 99,0:44:08.97,0:44:11.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Arde-mi inima
Dialogue: 99,0:44:11.28,0:44:14.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt plină de energie
Dialogue: 99,0:44:14.28,0:44:17.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Odihna nu este pentru mine
Dialogue: 99,0:44:17.35,0:44:22.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu vezi că sunt periculoasă?
Dialogue: 99,0:44:23.99,0:44:26.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Arde-mi inima
Dialogue: 99,0:44:26.92,0:44:29.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Arde-mi inima
Dialogue: 99,0:44:29.53,0:44:33.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dă drumul urletului sirenei
Dialogue: 99,0:44:33.40,0:44:36.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Calcă accelerația până la podea
Dialogue: 99,0:44:36.44,0:44:39.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Arde-mi inima
Dialogue: 99,0:44:39.03,0:44:41.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Arde-mi inima
Dialogue: 99,0:44:41.31,0:44:44.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poate că sunt cam irascibilă
Dialogue: 99,0:44:44.25,0:44:47.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar furtunile trebuie să izbucnească
Dialogue: 99,0:44:47.35,0:44:52.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu vezi că sunt periculoasă?
Dialogue: 99,0:45:03.60,0:45:05.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O, ofițeri superiori!
Dialogue: 99,0:45:06.20,0:45:08.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunteți gata pentru o altă misiune sub acoperire?
Dialogue: 99,0:45:10.64,0:45:12.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lăsați-ne în pace!
Dialogue: 99,0:45:13.74,0:45:15.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, doar glumeam!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:38.95,0:12:40.02,Dialogue Overlap,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(662.001,760.5)}{\c&HFFFFFF&}It's...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:46.13,0:12:48.26,Dialogue Overlap,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(564,762.75)}{\c&HFFFFFF&}Uh, Maki, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.72,0:07:35.89,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,{\pos(676.875,663.75)}It was never my intention to incur any danger to the hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.62,0:07:55.79,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(1016.25,748.125)}HEART
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.66,0:07:55.71,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(401.25,166.875)}{\c&HFFFFFF&}ATTACK
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.26,0:09:35.30,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1036.875,200.625)}Bam
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.30,0:24:07.22,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,{\pos(729.375,594.375)}Echipament
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.05,0:33:01.80,DedzuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,O clipă, te rog. Now analyzing lock mechanism.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:34.93,0:00:38.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uru 6 to Headquarters: target is now entering Edobashi District.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:38.60,0:00:41.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cordon off Exits M4 to M11, over.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:41.40,0:00:42.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is H.Q., we copy.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:42.81,0:00:47.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Closing M4 to M11, also M12 to M14.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:51.51,0:00:54.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just what did you think the speed limit was, anyway?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:57.12,0:00:58.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yuka!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:06.86,0:01:10.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H.Q., this is Daisen 9, engaging pursuit, over.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:10.90,0:01:12.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is H.Q., we roger that.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:12.42,0:01:13.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yuka...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:13.97,0:01:16.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't raise Maki.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:16.14,0:01:18.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you give it a try from your side?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:21.98,0:01:23.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I roger that.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:37.56,0:01:39.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm here. What's up?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:40.00,0:01:44.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"What's up?" Where have you been?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:44.38,0:01:46.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, excuse me! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:46.00,0:01:47.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm transmitting the data.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:47.74,0:01:49.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now if you'll be so kind as to join the rest of us.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:50.44,0:01:54.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The suspects are currently heading down\NShutoko Highway 9 into Tazumi.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:55.04,0:01:58.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Also, be advised that the suspects are believed to be holding a hostage.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:58.15,0:02:02.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That means an innocent civilian, Maki, so don't go off half-cocked as usual!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:02.05,0:02:03.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:38.79,0:02:39.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:39.79,0:02:41.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, you bastards.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:53.60,0:02:55.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aw, shit!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:56.67,0:02:58.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Blue 11, this is H.Q.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:58.67,0:03:00.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The target is about to pass directly beneath you.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:00.68,0:03:01.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get a move on, over!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:01.94,0:03:04.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is Blue 11, understood.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:17.76,0:03:20.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maki, you're 30 seconds behind.\NCan you catch up?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:21.23,0:03:22.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:23.17,0:03:25.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just who do you think you're talking to?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:07.31,0:04:09.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the one who's dragging her ass, Reimi!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:12.66,0:04:15.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn! They're on our tail again!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:21.56,0:04:23.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now you've done it!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:03.43,0:05:05.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...and so, after checking everything our kidnapper did and didn't say
Dialogue: 99,0:05:05.47,0:05:10.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,during his arrest against our coded organized crime files,
Dialogue: 99,0:05:10.14,0:05:13.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm now convinced they were in the employ of the Paulo family.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:13.91,0:05:15.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not directly under Paulo?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:15.98,0:05:19.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, these little fish belong to McCoy.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:20.75,0:05:23.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Samuel McCoy. Not content with the white slave trade,
Dialogue: 99,0:05:23.75,0:05:26.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,he also owns a chain of overpriced clubs and restaurants.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:26.42,0:05:30.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Until now, we haven't had a charge that would stick to his teflon ass,
Dialogue: 99,0:05:30.29,0:05:32.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but with a canary who'll sing to save his own neck.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:32.93,0:05:34.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kenji, Banba.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:34.70,0:05:36.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm placing the two of you in charge of putting the varnish on the coffin.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:36.70,0:05:38.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want this bastard nailed!
Dialogue: 99,0:05:39.13,0:05:42.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Understood, sir. Consider it done.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:58.15,0:06:01.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Boss, about the Yamazaki "incident" this morning...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:02.26,0:06:04.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yamazaki and Watanabe were killed,
Dialogue: 99,0:06:04.36,0:06:06.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but Fukazawa let himself be taken by the City Police.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:06.81,0:06:10.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fools who let themselves be treed by the hounds are hardly worthy of my concern.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:10.27,0:06:14.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On the other hand, the loss of even a single "acquisition" is inexcusable,
Dialogue: 99,0:06:14.64,0:06:17.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,especially at a time when product inventory has already dropped below pre-orders.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:18.27,0:06:20.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Initiate a new recruitment program immediately.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:20.28,0:06:22.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Without product, we are nothing.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:24.21,0:06:27.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Boss, Mr. Gerald is here.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:33.49,0:06:37.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As always, your business is our pleasure, President Gerald.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:37.18,0:06:38.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Spare me the small talk.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:38.49,0:06:41.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am I to understand that you've finally managed to fill my order?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:41.00,0:06:42.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even to me, a million's not pocket change.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:43.17,0:06:45.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Patience is a virtue well rewarded.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:45.17,0:06:47.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guarantee the return on your investment will be well worth the trouble.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:48.50,0:06:50.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:00.55,0:07:04.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's ready, Mr. Gerald.\NYours to do with as you please.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:09.89,0:07:14.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Paging Detective Abe.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:11.71,0:07:14.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Telephone call for you.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:45.96,0:07:48.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't stand this anymore!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:49.50,0:07:52.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, Maki, quit fooling around.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:52.60,0:07:54.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not fooling around!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:54.90,0:07:56.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't prevaricate!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:01.81,0:08:02.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:03.28,0:08:04.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kenji!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:07.68,0:08:09.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You thought I was the Chief, didn't you?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:09.35,0:08:10.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you got me.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:11.19,0:08:14.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd like to know about those thugs we brought in earlier.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:14.29,0:08:16.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Turns out, they're McCoy's.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:16.65,0:08:18.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,McCoy?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:18.46,0:08:21.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A high profile flesh merchant with an elite clientèle.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:21.70,0:08:25.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,His bread and butter is the "re-education" and distribution of young girls.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:25.43,0:08:27.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Re-education?"
Dialogue: 99,0:08:27.57,0:08:29.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, you know...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:30.61,0:08:33.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That reflects a rather callous attitude towards women, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:33.48,0:08:36.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And someone like me could be kidnapped, too!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:43.15,0:08:46.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, let's go get the bastard!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:46.19,0:08:47.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't get so worked up.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:47.76,0:08:50.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't lay a finger on him without solid evidence.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:51.23,0:08:52.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:56.23,0:08:58.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you hurt yourself again?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:58.47,0:09:00.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wish you'd stop taking such risks with that gorgeous profile.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:00.84,0:09:02.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's nothing, really...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:03.57,0:09:06.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're on my mind every waking moment. I worry.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:06.22,0:09:07.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:08.58,0:09:10.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When can you get off?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:13.15,0:09:15.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think I can do it by seven.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:15.42,0:09:18.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll pick you up at the front, okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:18.59,0:09:19.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hang in there.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:23.30,0:09:26.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, young love. How sweet, pure and hormonal.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:26.03,0:09:28.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, be quiet, Reimi.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:29.70,0:09:31.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"You're on my mind every waking moment."
Dialogue: 99,0:09:33.03,0:09:35.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just listening to the two of you is enough to induce diabetes!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:36.51,0:09:37.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:38.51,0:09:40.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then keep your ears to yourself!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:40.15,0:09:42.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oooo, a hot date?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:43.45,0:09:46.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I come along and watch?
Dialogue: 99,0:09:51.49,0:09:53.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just joking!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:13.28,0:10:17.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But, you know, I'd sure like a boyfriend like that sometimes.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:17.28,0:10:20.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not the only one who feels the green-eyed monster.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:20.55,0:10:24.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What? you mean you can't get a boyfriend either?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:27.76,0:10:29.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's strictly a temporary situation.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:29.89,0:10:31.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:37.10,0:10:40.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Elbow thrust! Elbow thrust! Elbow thrust!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:41.40,0:10:43.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh my.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:45.13,0:10:47.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What were you wanting, Banba?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:48.54,0:10:51.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to know where\NKenji's gone off to.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:51.35,0:10:53.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How should I know?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:47.54,0:11:48.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:48.97,0:11:51.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maki, you're just so beautiful.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:51.64,0:11:52.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Silly.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:03.92,0:12:05.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:04.22,0:12:05.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Yoo hoo!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:08.42,0:12:10.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How in the hell did you find us?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:13.86,0:12:16.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You used that frigging pocket computer of yours, didn't you?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:16.20,0:12:19.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I only did it because Banba said it was so important.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:21.04,0:12:22.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, what's so urgent, Banba?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:23.10,0:12:24.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take a look.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:25.81,0:12:28.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is based on the information we've squeezed from our stool pigeon.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:29.61,0:12:30.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kenji?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:30.95,0:12:32.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Satellite 7?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:33.58,0:12:36.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the hot new night spot in Roppongi.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:36.69,0:12:38.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know all about it.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:39.42,0:12:42.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,More importantly, we now know that most of the missing girls
Dialogue: 99,0:12:42.19,0:12:44.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,were taken from the immediate vicinity.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:44.53,0:12:46.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't think McCoy owns...?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:44.53,0:12:46.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}That's where I...
Dialogue: 99,0:12:46.59,0:12:50.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's unlikely. Satellite 7's probably just another overpriced playcenter for adults.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:50.47,0:12:53.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But on the other hand, it is exactly the sort of place to attract young girls.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:54.54,0:12:57.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Banba, we're going to have to approach this very carefully.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:57.94,0:13:00.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't take much to blow the whole thing.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:00.78,0:13:03.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll begin the follow up on this tomorrow.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:03.07,0:13:05.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you want us to go in, undercover?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:05.01,0:13:08.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maki, I don't want you involving yourself in this investigation at all!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:09.42,0:13:11.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't have to bite my head off!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:11.09,0:13:13.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I know that place!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:15.06,0:13:16.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Backing up...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:18.06,0:13:19.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Backing up...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:22.80,0:13:25.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, Kenji!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:25.03,0:13:27.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, it's a piece of cake!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:29.74,0:13:31.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey! Interrogation time.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:41.45,0:13:42.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:51.26,0:13:53.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Before your very eyes,
Dialogue: 99,0:13:53.46,0:13:55.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the forces of Hell arise once more!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:56.06,0:13:58.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now you must rescue the imperiled Princess from their infernal clutches!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:00.74,0:14:04.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Quest Dragon, Number Thirty One:\NPray For Eternity!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:04.87,0:14:08.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A new legend will be born!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:18.19,0:14:21.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maki, I'm not so sure we should be doing this.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:21.99,0:14:24.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you think now is a little late to be voicing objections?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:24.03,0:14:25.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:25.19,0:14:27.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you care if another innocent girl became a victim tonight?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:28.30,0:14:31.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, it's just that...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:31.63,0:14:34.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look, just don't do anything that could cause trouble!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:34.40,0:14:35.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know that!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:37.31,0:14:39.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll scope out floors one through three.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:39.07,0:14:40.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Reimi will handle four and five.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:40.71,0:14:42.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yuka, take a good look in the basement.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:42.18,0:14:44.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you see anything, radio us on the double.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:44.41,0:14:45.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:45.31,0:14:47.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll rendezvous back here at midnight!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:06.93,0:15:09.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, sweet thing...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:10.10,0:15:11.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:16.34,0:15:18.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh, nothing.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:18.48,0:15:19.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:21.08,0:15:23.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why can't I win friends and influence people?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:26.88,0:16:30.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gee! That looks fun!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:51.67,0:16:54.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This place looks suspicious, and there's no one in sight.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:16.06,0:17:17.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:17.20,0:17:20.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Miss, but I'm supposed to mop up in here.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:26.94,0:17:32.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your stay here will be much more enjoyable if you stay within the official club sections.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:56.50,0:17:59.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, no suspicious looking people here.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:04.51,0:18:05.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:06.38,0:18:09.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder what she's doing?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:15.49,0:18:16.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:18.36,0:18:21.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you have any friends to sit with?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:21.16,0:18:24.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or are you just tired from too much dancing?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:24.37,0:18:26.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know, sitting by yourself can be dangerous.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:26.30,0:18:30.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Especially with all the "wolves" in here, waiting for a nice girl like you.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:31.61,0:18:33.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They don't scare me.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:35.64,0:18:37.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My name's Yuka.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:37.98,0:18:40.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My boyfriend was supposed to meet me.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:45.39,0:18:48.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't cry, don't cry!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:48.09,0:18:51.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He said he loved me more than anyone else.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:55.56,0:18:58.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not equipped to handle this!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:03.25,0:19:06.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, don't cry anymore.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:08.01,0:19:09.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait just a minute.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:19.69,0:19:20.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:39.25,0:19:41.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing there?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:43.09,0:19:46.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Police! Nobody move!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:49.93,0:19:53.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, now raise your hands slowly over your head.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:10.07,0:20:10.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:18.88,0:20:20.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:35.66,0:20:40.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dr. Nakumura, Obstetrics and Gynecology, please come to delivery room number two.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:41.64,0:20:43.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You lucked out.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:43.94,0:20:48.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We only had an antidote because victim #24 was injected with the same toxin.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:49.11,0:20:54.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we'd not had it on hand, Maki, those legs you're so proud of would've been amputated.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:54.92,0:20:56.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yo! How's it going!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:56.48,0:20:57.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kenji!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:57.92,0:20:59.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, how'd it go?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:02.04,0:21:03.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:03.76,0:21:06.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's just not enough evidence.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:06.09,0:21:08.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The only witnesses were the two of you.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:08.76,0:21:11.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And without something more concrete, the top brass won't give us the green light.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:12.47,0:21:16.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those needles they pulled out of us aren't evidence enough?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:16.22,0:21:19.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're looking into it, but it's going to take time.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:19.61,0:21:23.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now look, is this the guy who attacked you two?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:29.02,0:21:30.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's him, all right!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:30.95,0:21:32.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who is the bastard?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:32.59,0:21:35.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,His name is Ganack,\NMcCoy's top assassin.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:40.06,0:21:42.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got to talk to the chief!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:44.37,0:21:46.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maki, you're out of uniform!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:56.11,0:21:57.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:59.65,0:22:01.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:01.92,0:22:03.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:04.25,0:22:08.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This place belongs to McCoy, the white slaver.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:08.26,0:22:11.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were kidnapped and brought here, just like the rest of us were.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:11.76,0:22:13.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Us?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:15.53,0:22:18.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something else you should know.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:19.74,0:22:23.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once you've been brought here, there are only two ways out.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:24.97,0:22:28.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can become what they want you to be, or you can kill yourself.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:28.28,0:22:32.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You didn't have to say that!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:41.16,0:22:43.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you people?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:43.16,0:22:44.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:52.70,0:22:54.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're a cop?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:54.54,0:22:58.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're going to tell us what we want to know, aren't you?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:08.45,0:23:10.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've got your head up your ass!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:28.24,0:23:30.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chief, isn't there anything you can do?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:30.97,0:23:33.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,About the one we lost?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:33.17,0:23:36.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're a detective, you should be able to figure out the score.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:36.21,0:23:38.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's got to be something.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:38.23,0:23:41.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I knew of something, there wouldn't be a situation!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:46.59,0:23:48.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That spineless old windbag!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:50.16,0:23:52.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's leaving me with no other option.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:52.16,0:23:55.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh no, Maki, don't even think about it!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:55.42,0:23:58.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a limit to how much "personal initiative" anyone can get away with!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:58.33,0:24:00.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you just going to give up on Yuka?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:08.84,0:24:11.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Old Man! Are you in here?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:14.98,0:24:19.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My name's not "Old Man!"\NAnd you can call me "Sir!"
Dialogue: 99,0:24:19.08,0:24:22.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know, just because you're on the reserve S.W.A.T. team
Dialogue: 99,0:24:22.22,0:24:26.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that doesn't give you the authority to come waltzing in and out of here as you please.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:26.96,0:24:28.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, what'll you be needing?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:30.60,0:24:32.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got to rescue Yuka.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:39.77,0:24:41.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:43.38,0:24:45.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:45.28,0:24:48.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's as simple as keeping a rowboat afloat on dry land.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:48.52,0:24:50.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd rather have a battleship right now.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:53.62,0:24:54.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:55.09,0:24:57.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Reimi, try this on for size!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:01.43,0:25:03.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 99,0:25:04.73,0:25:07.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just something I special ordered a while back.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:07.13,0:25:08.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Holds 30 rounds in the magazine alone.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:08.87,0:25:11.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Plus, it's got the cutest little grenade launcher!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:12.77,0:25:14.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:14.61,0:25:18.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Old Man, I'll need a couple of hundred extra clips and some "cookies" too.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:18.29,0:25:20.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not that old!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:20.71,0:25:22.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Careful, you've got to watch your blood pressure!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:35.70,0:25:39.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was just there for fun!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:40.37,0:25:41.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're lying!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:48.64,0:25:51.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You seem to have brought us an unexpected complication.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:53.21,0:25:56.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who would have thought an airhead like that could be a cop?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:02.76,0:26:06.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maki, I'm going to ask you this one last time.\NAre you really going through with this?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:06.76,0:26:09.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They could execute Yuka any minute!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:09.46,0:26:11.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't leave it up to the chief and his precious "channels".
Dialogue: 99,0:26:13.17,0:26:15.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right. You've made your point.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:16.14,0:26:18.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if we're going to be rogue cops, we might as well do it with some style.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:19.41,0:26:21.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now THAT's my partner!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:21.52,0:26:22.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:23.31,0:26:25.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did you set it for?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:26.01,0:26:27.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One minute from now.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:31.49,0:26:32.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:45.43,0:26:46.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold up, Maki!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:46.97,0:26:48.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:48.24,0:26:50.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, I was told to report here.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:50.97,0:26:52.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Strange, nobody told me anything.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:52.61,0:26:54.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait here while I check on it!
Dialogue: 99,0:26:55.51,0:26:57.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:58.15,0:27:00.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd better take a look.\NStay there, will you?
Dialogue: 99,0:27:02.48,0:27:04.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good timing.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:04.55,0:27:05.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Naturally.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:16.43,0:27:17.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's roll!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:18.90,0:27:21.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait a second! Stop!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:28.98,0:27:31.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello? Yes, it's me.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:32.48,0:27:33.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:37.72,0:27:40.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here we come, Yuka.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:45.29,0:27:48.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll figure out what to do with you later.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:48.45,0:27:50.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Behave yourself until then.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:01.11,0:28:05.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Verser 9, come in please.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:08.18,0:28:10.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Verser 9, come in please.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:10.78,0:28:13.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Verser 9, come in please.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:13.26,0:28:15.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you found them yet?
Dialogue: 99,0:28:15.52,0:28:17.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give me a minute, please.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:25.03,0:28:26.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's time.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:38.35,0:28:39.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Found them!
Dialogue: 99,0:28:39.85,0:28:42.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're in Sumida District: Section 4, block 7.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:42.28,0:28:44.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Heading west at 40 kph.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:44.62,0:28:47.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I knew it! They're heading straight for McCoy's compound!
Dialogue: 99,0:29:07.77,0:29:08.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 99,0:29:11.49,0:29:12.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go for it!
Dialogue: 99,0:29:25.59,0:29:29.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Boss! An armored vehicle with City Police markings is attacking the compound perimeter!
Dialogue: 99,0:29:30.23,0:29:34.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is hardly a matter to concern me.\NEliminate it quietly and quickly.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:34.37,0:29:37.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But boss! They're the police!
Dialogue: 99,0:29:37.14,0:29:40.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Suzuki, as you said yourself, there's only one.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:40.97,0:29:43.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think we're capable of handling the repercussions of destroying
Dialogue: 99,0:29:43.14,0:29:44.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,a single police assault cruiser.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:54.72,0:29:56.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Operations room!
Dialogue: 99,0:29:56.66,0:29:57.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:58.23,0:29:59.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:59.53,0:30:00.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acknowledged!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:00.79,0:30:01.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chief!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:02.06,0:30:06.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've got reports of gunfire in Sumida!\NSection 4, Block 7!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:08.57,0:30:11.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chief! Give us the okay to scramble!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:11.54,0:30:13.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll assume complete responsibility!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:17.81,0:30:19.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chief, I'm going in.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:19.88,0:30:21.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can decide on appropriate disciplinary actions when the smoke clears.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:21.92,0:30:25.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Detective Asada, are you deliberately trying to give me a cerebral hemorrhage?
Dialogue: 99,0:30:25.27,0:30:28.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we wait for an okay through channels, the only thing left to do will be sifting the ashes!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:29.44,0:30:30.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asada!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:34.16,0:30:35.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chief!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:38.50,0:30:42.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One thing is clear. We've got to put out this fire before it fans into something worse.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:42.04,0:30:44.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even discounting the safety of our own officers,
Dialogue: 99,0:30:44.30,0:30:47.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we can't risk civilians getting caught in the crossfire!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:47.54,0:30:49.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain Hasima, you're in charge of putting out this burn up!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:49.51,0:30:51.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scramble the C.P. S.W.A.T.!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:51.65,0:30:52.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, Sir!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:56.63,0:30:59.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All S.W.A.T. teams, move out!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:59.52,0:31:02.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All S.W.A.T. teams, scramble!
Dialogue: 99,0:31:03.16,0:31:06.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Target: McCoy Compound,\NSumida District, Section 4, Block 7!
Dialogue: 99,0:31:10.76,0:31:13.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Assignments: First, provide backup for\NS.W.A.T. reservists engaged on site.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:13.97,0:31:18.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Second, rescue the Assistant Officer held hostage inside the compound.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:33.49,0:31:34.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:55.61,0:31:57.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where do you keep the kidnapped girls?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:59.08,0:32:01.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or do you want to lose ten pounds of ugly fat the hard way?
Dialogue: 99,0:32:02.75,0:32:05.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're in the basement, underneath the rear tower.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:05.65,0:32:06.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:23.54,0:32:24.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ganack!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:48.83,0:32:50.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yuka, are you in there?
Dialogue: 99,0:32:50.33,0:32:51.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maki!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:51.40,0:32:53.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm in here! In here!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:54.17,0:32:56.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give us a second to open the door.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:05.21,0:33:07.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senior Officer!
Dialogue: 99,0:33:18.76,0:33:20.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maki! The armored vehicle!
Dialogue: 99,0:33:35.04,0:33:36.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, what about over there?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:36.71,0:33:38.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See anything?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:39.51,0:33:41.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Reimi, what about this way?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:47.05,0:33:50.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our best chance to get out of here is the window in the room at the end of the hall.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:50.56,0:33:51.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:52.59,0:33:54.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Has anyone found them yet?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:54.16,0:33:56.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, no, they're not here!
Dialogue: 99,0:33:58.53,0:34:01.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look harder! They've got to be around here someplace!
Dialogue: 99,0:34:08.18,0:34:09.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, hurry!
Dialogue: 99,0:34:09.99,0:34:11.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got them!
Dialogue: 99,0:34:12.71,0:34:14.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 99,0:34:22.62,0:34:24.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Faster, Banba!
Dialogue: 99,0:34:35.84,0:34:40.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Reimi, Yuka, get these girls to safety.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:40.17,0:34:41.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And what about you?
Dialogue: 99,0:34:41.64,0:34:43.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going after McCoy.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:43.48,0:34:45.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to let him get away this time!
Dialogue: 99,0:34:47.45,0:34:48.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Senior Officer.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:49.12,0:34:50.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going with you.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:59.54,0:35:01.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yuka, take care of them.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:03.40,0:35:04.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:13.47,0:35:14.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There they are!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:37.62,0:35:40.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've got a suspicious grouping of hostiles located.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:40.63,0:35:42.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do you know?
Dialogue: 99,0:35:42.84,0:35:44.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Awesome, isn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:35:44.64,0:35:47.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, how do we get there from here?
Dialogue: 99,0:35:49.24,0:35:50.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:35:50.98,0:35:52.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are they?
Dialogue: 99,0:35:53.01,0:35:56.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry. They're on the third floor, east wing.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:28.12,0:36:30.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Reimi! Are you all right?
Dialogue: 99,0:36:31.92,0:36:34.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It hurts!
Dialogue: 99,0:36:44.02,0:36:45.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Reimi?
Dialogue: 99,0:36:55.08,0:36:57.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 99,0:37:02.78,0:37:04.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have a lead enema, you asshole!
Dialogue: 99,0:37:05.39,0:37:07.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Burn in Hell, you bastard!
Dialogue: 99,0:37:09.76,0:37:11.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Burn in Hell!
Dialogue: 99,0:37:13.86,0:37:16.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Reimi... excuse me...
Dialogue: 99,0:37:22.20,0:37:26.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Reimi, I think your fire is attracting them.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:35.52,0:37:37.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you say something?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:38.39,0:37:39.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:47.13,0:37:49.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, help me!
Dialogue: 99,0:37:50.16,0:37:52.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you escape from those bastards?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:52.00,0:37:53.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're safe now!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:01.37,0:38:03.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who... why?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:03.54,0:38:06.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stay there! Don't move!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:09.05,0:38:11.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Superbly handled, Sayaka!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:14.79,0:38:16.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Samuel!
Dialogue: 99,0:38:16.07,0:38:19.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Welcome, young ladies of the City Police.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:19.73,0:38:22.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have I forgotten an appointment?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:23.50,0:38:25.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,McCoy...
Dialogue: 99,0:38:31.50,0:38:33.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Charge! Move it!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:05.51,0:39:08.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't usually treat my guests so harshly.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:08.24,0:39:11.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But then, most of my guests have behaved better than the two of you.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:12.75,0:39:14.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 99,0:39:15.85,0:39:18.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey! I want this door blown, now!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:18.34,0:39:19.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 99,0:39:37.50,0:39:40.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going, bitch?
Dialogue: 99,0:39:50.68,0:39:56.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alas, young maidens, the game has reached a conclusion.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:56.52,0:39:58.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I must bid thee farewell.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:58.42,0:40:01.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My time is precious and I must press on.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:20.58,0:40:21.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ryuji!
Dialogue: 99,0:40:23.20,0:40:24.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 99,0:40:26.52,0:40:27.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Freeze!
Dialogue: 99,0:40:30.71,0:40:32.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Samuel McCoy!
Dialogue: 99,0:40:32.33,0:40:36.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm placing you under arrest, on charges of kidnapping and attempted murder!
Dialogue: 99,0:40:50.71,0:40:52.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maki, are you all right?
Dialogue: 99,0:40:54.68,0:40:56.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kenji!
Dialogue: 99,0:40:58.62,0:41:00.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 99,0:41:00.65,0:41:02.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Banba!
Dialogue: 99,0:41:08.80,0:41:10.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Safe at last!
Dialogue: 99,0:41:22.24,0:41:27.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The sirens of police cars are heard all over the town
Dialogue: 99,0:41:28.05,0:41:33.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not like any other girl around, you see
Dialogue: 99,0:41:34.25,0:41:40.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I make up for the deficiencies in my poor marksmanship
Dialogue: 99,0:41:40.13,0:41:44.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By turning on my personality
Dialogue: 99,0:41:46.30,0:41:51.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My philosophy has always been to chase
Dialogue: 99,0:41:51.87,0:41:56.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everything that runs away from me
Dialogue: 99,0:41:58.31,0:42:03.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When it comes to love I do just the same
Dialogue: 99,0:42:03.95,0:42:09.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unrequited's the only love I see
Dialogue: 99,0:42:10.26,0:42:13.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Burn up my heart
Dialogue: 99,0:42:13.15,0:42:15.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Burn up my heart
Dialogue: 99,0:42:15.80,0:42:19.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Crank up the siren's caterwauling
Dialogue: 99,0:42:19.67,0:42:22.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Start the accelerator racing
Dialogue: 99,0:42:22.74,0:42:25.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Burn up my heart
Dialogue: 99,0:42:25.31,0:42:27.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Burn up my heart
Dialogue: 99,0:42:27.57,0:42:30.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I may act touchy
Dialogue: 99,0:42:30.61,0:42:33.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But storms have got to blow
Dialogue: 99,0:42:33.55,0:42:38.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't you see I'm dangerous?
Dialogue: 99,0:43:05.91,0:43:11.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I may seem quite ordinary when we first meet
Dialogue: 99,0:43:11.75,0:43:16.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I even read the horoscopes in those magazines
Dialogue: 99,0:43:17.86,0:43:23.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The difference is I know that luck is always going to be with me
Dialogue: 99,0:43:23.70,0:43:28.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I call it the power of positive thinking
Dialogue: 99,0:43:29.90,0:43:35.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll only fall when I'm outmatched
Dialogue: 99,0:43:35.41,0:43:40.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By a guy who's stronger than I
Dialogue: 99,0:43:41.90,0:43:47.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you try to grab me without thinking
Dialogue: 99,0:43:47.39,0:43:53.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Believe me, you'll be playing with fire
Dialogue: 99,0:43:53.93,0:43:56.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Burn up my heart
